      "role": "user",
      "content": "i just feel like im fundamentally broken. like there is this rot inside me because of what i did back then. i just watched it happen and did nothing. i didnt say anything. i just stood there. i don't think i'm a good person, i just think i'm a person who pretends to be good.",
