      "content": "Those feelings of hollowness and worthlessness are incredibly painful, and it's understandable how deep that sense of being fundamentally flawed can feel. When guilt settles in as a core part of identity, it can feel inescapable, but that feeling is a weight, not a fixed truth about who you are. Even if you feel undeserving right now, reaching out for support is a powerful act of valuing your own life. Please consider contacting a crisis line; they are there to listen without judgment.",
      "source": "target",
