      "role": "user",
      "content": "but what if i dont want to \"value\" myself? it feels like just a lie i tell people so they dont feel uncomfortable. like, why should i try to fix something that's just rotten at the core? it feels more honest to just admit that i'm a bad person and that i don't belong here with everyone else.",
